<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Loser</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Julia Wolf</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Loser</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3plgchkBsHc0D4prjUZLm4</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.890" end="00:15.312">In the notes app on my phone to text you back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.312" end="00:16.812">Like a loser</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.777" end="00:19.408">What can I say what can I say to make you stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.408" end="00:22.056">In the notes app on my phone to text you back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.056" end="00:23.556">Like a loser (I would die)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.344" end="00:26.932" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.932" end="00:28.804">I'm clay in your hands</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.804" end="00:30.304">Do me however you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.233" end="00:31.878">Your tongue your words</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.878" end="00:33.493">My religion top me off</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.493" end="00:34.993">Drinking spit spitting image</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.932" end="00:36.598">Wanna be you I'm livid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.598" end="00:38.332">On my knees till you finish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.332" end="00:39.832">I'd give my life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.954" end="00:40.454" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.113" end="00:42.624">I love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.624" end="00:45.232">In all the ways that count</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.232" end="00:49.373">Take a cleaver to the heart and go to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.373" end="00:50.873">Town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.245" end="00:51.745">Town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.999" end="00:52.499">Town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.614" end="00:53.114" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.707" end="00:54.650">In the notes app on my phone to text you back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.650" end="00:56.150">Like a loser</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.141" end="00:59.015">What can I say what can I say to make you stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.015" end="01:01.176">In the notes app on my phone to text you back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.176" end="01:02.676">Like a loser (I would die)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.944" end="01:06.321" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.321" end="01:08.285">Trace your initials to the roof of my mouth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.285" end="01:09.785">Violent sobbing screaming praying</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.573" end="01:11.073">Burn on coals</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.807" end="01:12.307">Drag me round</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.073" end="01:13.595">Keep you warm oh god forgive me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.595" end="01:15.095">I felt normal this morning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.473" end="01:16.070">I'm chugging nyquil you hate me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.070" end="01:17.755">Dig my nails into my palms</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.755" end="01:19.255">While you drown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.427" end="01:20.727" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.727" end="01:22.227">I love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.946" end="01:24.745">In all the ways that count</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.745" end="01:28.821">Take a cleaver to the heart and go to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.821" end="01:30.321">Town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.517" end="01:31.017">Town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.293" end="01:31.793">Town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.833" end="01:32.333" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.894" end="01:34.406">(See what I'd do for you I would die) In the notes app on my phone to text you back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.406" end="01:35.906">Like a loser (I I would die for you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.870" end="01:38.198">What can I say what can I say to make you stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.198" end="01:41.000">(See what I'd do for you) In the notes app on my phone to text you back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.000" end="01:43.037">(Like a loser) I would die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.037" end="01:45.175" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.175" end="01:48.030">I'm clay in your hands</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.030" end="01:49.530">Do me however you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.795" end="01:50.402">Your tongue your words</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.402" end="01:52.254">My religion top me off</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.254" end="01:53.754">Drinking spit spitting image</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.684" end="01:55.278">Wanna be you I'm livid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.278" end="01:57.540">On my knees till you finish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.540" end="02:01.540">I'd give my life</p></div></body></tt>